 "notes": "Outcomes a to d are KICD's words (verified). The range is small: a multiplies up to a two-digit number by a multiple of 10 (for example 24 x 30), b multiplies two 2-digit numbers, c estimates with products not above 1,000 and d makes patterns with products not above 100. Outcome b says 'with and without regrouping', so it is two skills. HOREB's outcome list had folded a and b together.",
